WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.550
A mostly buried Bobbit worm waits at a sandy burrow as a fish approaches.

00:01.550 --> 00:02.100
The worm strikes upward, catches the fish in its jaws, and withdraws.

00:02.100 --> 00:04.000
The worm and prey disappear beneath the sand; the opening is quiet again.
